# Ensure binary/media assets are never line-ending normalized or diffed.
# (repo has core.autocrlf=true; without these rules a mis-detected asset
#  could be corrupted on checkout, which breaks image deploys.)
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.otf   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.zip   binary
